  [codex] +## Case 2: Proverbs 1-2
  [codex] +
  [codex] +Run slug: `2026-03-13__043207__competition-volume-1__12-day__vol-1`
  [codex] +
  [codex] +### Executive Judgment
  [codex] +The first-eye system is mostly in the right textual neighborhood but still fails the late-week sequence because it flattens a wisdom-warning escalation into one repeated frame. This is primarily a structural and interpretive problem, not a theological one. Days 6 and 7 repeat the same `truthfulness under pressure` lane even though the passage is moving from threatened calamity to the exposed culpability of refusing wisdom, and day 8 does not turn sharply enough into the calm security of listening. The smallest repair is burden reassignment plus narrow rewrites of exposition, action, and prayer.
  [codex] +
